<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea KDB bank to supply 30 bln won to Kia Steel.</title>
<headline>S.Korea KDB bank to supply 30 bln won to Kia Steel.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Korea Development Bank said on Wednesday it had decided to extend 30 billion won in emergency loans to debt-stricken Kia Steel, a unit of the Kia Group.</p>
<p>&quot;The company will be able to get the loans from this week,&quot; an official at the bank said.</p>
</text>
